{"id":"ecf0316ce54c8b96","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-alternating-reachability.md","title":"交替可达性 REACH a","display":"df-alternating-reachability — 交替可达性 REACH_a","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-alternating-reachability","aliases":["29-df-alternating-reachability"],"display":"df-alternating-reachability — 交替可达性 REACH_a","depends_on":["[[29-df-standard-inputs]]","[[29-df-reach]]","[[29-df-struc]]"],"source_locator":"Definition3.24, pp.53–54, scans68–69"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-alternating-reachability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-alternating-reachability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-alternating-reachability — 交替可达性 REACH_a"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4563061cac782dab\" href=\"?note=4563061cac782dab\" title=\"29-df-standard-inputs\">29-df-standard-inputs</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9403bcdfde263660\" href=\"?note=9403bcdfde263660\" title=\"29-df-reach\">29-df-reach</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4de8e0c8085801f5\" href=\"?note=4de8e0c8085801f5\" title=\"29-df-struc\">29-df-struc</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Definition3.24, pp.53–54, scans68–69"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau_{\\mathrm{digraph}}]\">\\(G\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau_{\\mathrm{digraph}}]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in|G|\">\\(s,t\\in|G|\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_\\exists,V_\\forall\\subseteq|G|\">\\(V_\\exists,V_\\forall\\subseteq|G|\\)</span> 是不交且并为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|G|\">\\(|G|\\)</span> 的标记集，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9403bcdfde263660\" href=\"?note=9403bcdfde263660\" title=\"29-df-reach\">29-df-reach</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq|G|\">\\(X\\subseteq|G|\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F^0(\\varnothing)=\\varnothing\">\\(F^0(\\varnothing)=\\varnothing\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F^{i+1}(\\varnothing)=F(F^i(\\varnothing))\">\\(F^{i+1}(\\varnothing)=F(F^i(\\varnothing))\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{outdeg}_G\">\\(\\operatorname{outdeg}_G\\)</span> 见该上游。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{ag}=\\langle E^{(2)},A^{(1)},s,t\\rangle\">\\(\\tau_{ag}=\\langle E^{(2)},A^{(1)},s,t\\rangle\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>标记全称顶点；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StdSTRUC}\">\\(\\mathrm{StdSTRUC}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4563061cac782dab\" href=\"?note=4563061cac782dab\" title=\"29-df-standard-inputs\">29-df-standard-inputs</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"F_{G,t,V_\\exists,V_\\forall}(X)\\coloneqq\\{t\\}\\cup\\{v\\in V_\\exists\\mid\\exists u\\in X\\;(v,u)\\in E^G\\}\\cup\\{v\\in V_\\forall\\mid\\operatorname{outdeg}_G(v)&gt;0\\land\\forall u\\in|G|\\;((v,u)\\in E^G\\to u\\in X)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[F_{G,t,V_\\exists,V_\\forall}(X)\\coloneqq\\{t\\}\\cup\\{v\\in V_\\exists\\mid\\exists u\\in X\\;(v,u)\\in E^G\\}\\cup\\{v\\in V_\\forall\\mid\\operatorname{outdeg}_G(v)&gt;0\\land\\forall u\\in|G|\\;((v,u)\\in E^G\\to u\\in X)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Win}_a(G,t,V_\\exists,V_\\forall)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i\\in\\mathbb N}F_{G,t,V_\\exists,V_\\forall}^i(\\varnothing).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Win}_a(G,t,V_\\exists,V_\\forall)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{i\\in\\mathbb N}F_{G,t,V_\\exists,V_\\forall}^i(\\varnothing).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{REACH}_a\\coloneqq\\{\\langle G,s,t,V_\\exists,V_\\forall\\rangle\\mid G\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau_{\\mathrm{digraph}}],\\ s,t\\in|G|,\\ V_\\exists\\cap V_\\forall=\\varnothing,\\ V_\\exists\\cup V_\\forall=|G|,\\ s\\in\\operatorname{Win}_a(G,t,V_\\exists,V_\\forall)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{REACH}_a\\coloneqq\\{\\langle G,s,t,V_\\exists,V_\\forall\\rangle\\mid G\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau_{\\mathrm{digraph}}],\\ s,t\\in|G|,\\ V_\\exists\\cap V_\\forall=\\varnothing,\\ V_\\exists\\cup V_\\forall=|G|,\\ s\\in\\operatorname{Win}_a(G,t,V_\\exists,V_\\forall)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{REACH}_a^{\\mathrm{std}}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathrm{StdSTRUC}[\\tau_{ag}]\\mid\\langle\\langle|B|,E^B\\rangle,s^B,t^B,|B|\\setminus A^B,A^B\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{REACH}_a\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{REACH}_a^{\\mathrm{std}}\\coloneqq\\{B\\in\\mathrm{StdSTRUC}[\\tau_{ag}]\\mid\\langle\\langle|B|,E^B\\rangle,s^B,t^B,|B|\\setminus A^B,A^B\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{REACH}_a\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Definition3.24，印刷页53–54、扫描页68–69。每个算子阶段只使用前一阶段，单调性及有限域保证并集为最小接受集合；没有后继的全称顶点不因空全称而自动获胜。新增实际结构查询接口，保留原五元组接口。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","tex